## FILE ORGANIZATION RULES

### Where to Put New Code

```
Business Logic:
✅ app/Models/ - Simple accessors, relationships
✅ app/Services/ - Complex calculations, multi-step processes
✅ app/Observers/ - Model event handling (create, update, delete)
✅ app/Policies/ - Authorization logic

UI Layer:
✅ app/Filament/Resources/ - CRUD interfaces
✅ app/Filament/Pages/ - Custom pages (dashboard, calendar, reports)
✅ app/Filament/Widgets/ - Dashboard components
✅ resources/views/components/ - Reusable Blade components

API Layer:
✅ app/Http/Controllers/Api/ - API endpoints
✅ app/Http/Resources/ - JSON transformers
✅ routes/api.php - API routes (tenant-aware via header)

Database:
✅ database/migrations/tenant/ - Tenant database tables
✅ database/migrations/ - Central database tables (tenants, domains)
✅ database/seeders/ - Default data (roles, permissions, categories)

Multi-Tenancy:
✅ app/Services/TenantFileService.php - Tenant file operations
✅ routes/tenant.php - Tenant-specific routes
✅ config/tenancy.php - Multi-tenancy configuration
```

