// ✅ Document complex business logic
/**
 * Calculate debt from customer for this order.
 * 
 * This represents the amount the customer still owes on the order.
 * Formula: price_to_customer - SUM(paid revenue documents)
 * 
 * @return float Remaining debt in currency units (e.g., BGN)
