## COMMON PITFALLS TO AVOID

### ❌ Don't Do This
```php
// 1. Don't add tenant_id to tenant tables
$table->foreignId('tenant_id'); // ❌

// 2. Don't query without eager loading
Order::all()->each(fn($o) => $o->client->name); // ❌ N+1

// 3. Don't use raw queries without parameterization
DB::select("SELECT * FROM orders WHERE id = $id"); // ❌ SQL injection

// 4. Don't put business logic in controllers
public function store(Request $request) {
    $order = Order::create($request->all());
    $order->number = Order::max('number') + 1; // ❌ Should be in observer
    $order->save();
}

// 5. Don't forget to test tenant isolation
// Every new model needs isolation test! ❌ Missing test

// 6. Don't commit without running tests
git commit -m "fix" // ❌ No tests run

// 7. Don't use $guarded = []
protected $guarded = []; // ❌ Mass assignment vulnerability

// 8. Don't skip validation
Order::create($request->all()); // ❌ No validation

// 9. Don't ignore type hints
public function calculate($order) { // ❌ No types
    return $order->total - $order->paid; // ❌ No return type
}

// 10. Don't put HTML in models
public function getLink() {
    return "<a href='/orders/$this->id'>$this->number</a>"; // ❌
}
```

